---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="section-heading">About Me</h1>
        <div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert">
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-8">
            I'm Unggul Cahya Saputra, a technology leader based in Jakarta, Indonesia, passionate about building open-source solutions, driving digital transformation, and strengthening cybersecurity awareness across the archipelago.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">My Journey</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            With over 15 years of experience in technology and innovation, I've dedicated my career to advancing Indonesia's digital ecosystem. As a Founder and CTO of multiple ventures, I've worked across diverse sectors including healthcare IT, cybersecurity, transportation technology, and education.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Core Focus Areas</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            <li><strong>Open Source Innovation</strong> — Building accessible, sustainable technology solutions</li>
            <li><strong>Digital Transformation</strong> — Helping organizations modernize their operations</li>
            <li><strong>Cybersecurity</strong> — Protecting Indonesia's digital infrastructure</li>
            <li><strong>Healthcare IT</strong> — Improving healthcare delivery through technology</li>
            <li><strong>Community Empowerment</strong> — Building digital literacy and skills</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Mission</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            I believe that technology should serve everyone. My mission is to build solutions that are accessible, secure, and beneficial for Indonesian businesses and citizens. Through AhliWeb, SatpamSiber, Literasi.top, and other ventures, I'm working to create a more digitally-empowered Indonesia.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Values</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            <li><strong>Innovation</strong> — Constantly exploring new technologies and approaches</li>
            <li><strong>Integrity</strong> — Building trust through transparency and ethics</li>
            <li><strong>Impact</strong> — Creating meaningful change for communities</li>
            <li><strong>Collaboration</strong> — Working together to achieve more</li>
            <li><strong>Sustainability</strong> — Building solutions that last</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>